      "created_at": "2014-08-15T18:47:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>From what experience I have, the materially feels like it will need a primer. You’ll probably be ok without one, but the amount of play they get will lead to chips if you don’t seal them. I would take a foot of one and test it out, that way if it’s a problem you can do a little artsy flock around the base to cover it up</p>",
