      "id": 114953,
      "name": "wyken09",
      "username": "wyken09",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/f19dbf/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-15T18:49:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I painted one of the Proletariats without primer last night as I only have black primer currently and it worked okay. &nbsp;The first layer ran a little but other than that the paint seemed to stick fine. &nbsp;I will likely pick up some white primer at some point as it will take me awhile to paint all of the miniatures and try with the primer. &nbsp;The problem is that a lot of the details aren't very deep on the minis so I am worried about getting the paint too thick.</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:46:59.533Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
