      "raw": "<p>I painted one of the Proletariats without primer last night as I only have black primer currently and it worked okay. &nbsp;The first layer ran a little but other than that the paint seemed to stick fine. &nbsp;I will likely pick up some white primer at some point as it will take me awhile to paint all of the miniatures and try with the primer. &nbsp;The problem is that a lot of the details aren&#39;t very deep on the minis so I am worried about getting the paint too thick.</p>",
